Z||000002||WhiteFieroBlur||11-04-2001||09:23 PM||||I am having some kind of charging problem also. For the last couple of weeks when I put in my key and begin to start up, my meter would be almost in the red. Then I start it up and everything seems fine. Then I drive around and turn off the car and wanna start it again and the needle is almost in the red. Sometimes it hesitates when I start the car like I don't have enough juice to start off with. But when it does start I have no volt trouble. I don't know whats going on cause my battery and alt occording to the auto place is good. <P> But lately when I start it it up the needle seems to be fine and charged up normally I guess. So I don't know what went on with my car. <P> I am thinking its time for a fresh belt on for me anyways. Are you sure the belt is really ok and on tight and all that?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Fiero*101||11-04-2001||10:33 PM||||I had the same problem about a month and a half ago. The alt was only a month old. So i was like what the heck? So i went and got it tested and sure enough the stupid thing was fried. So i got a new one and its been running great so far (knock on wood)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>So go get it checked out and see whats up<P>------------------<BR>Fiero*101<BR>Gold 86 SE 2M6||||reg||1
